    {
      "id": 900,
      "definition": {
        "type": "group",
        "title": "How to read this dashboard",
        "layout_type": "ordered",
        "show_title": true,
        "widgets": [
          {
            "id": 901,
            "definition": {
              "type": "note",
              "content": "## Data coverage\n\n**Live-span dashboard.** `click_dog.source=span_log` spans from `system.opentelemetry_span_log`, queried as `resource_name:query @click_dog.source:span_log`. Needs click-dog `v26.03.1`+.\n\n**Volume = exported queries, not total ClickHouse traffic** — only the stream selected by `monitor.min_trace_duration_ms` and filters. For total volume use the [Datadog ClickHouse integration](https://app.datadoghq.com/dash/integration/30297).\n\n**Dimensions.** Automatic `query_log.*` enrichment needs no tagging; `log_comment.*` attribution needs client tagging.\n\n**Backfill** is separate: `click_dog.source=query_log` / `clickhouse.query` / `db.*` spans — use trace search.\n\nSQL in tables is an exported preview and may already be truncated by `max_query_length`. Search filters the returned top 10 rows; use **View query family traces** for the matching family and selected time range. Double-click a widget title for full screen.\n\n## Key Metrics\nAre traces flowing, current volume, p95/p99 latency, slow-query count, top contributors — out of the box.\n\n## Failures\nFailed queries via `@query_log.exception_code` (`query_log` enrichment only — `span_log` has no error status). No data can mean no matching failures or missing telemetry; confirm other widgets are populated.\n\n## By ClickHouse User & Client\n`@query_log.user` and `@query_log.client_name` — automatic, no tagging.\n\n## Per-host Distribution\n`@hostname` from each span — automatic, no tagging.\n\n## Resource Usage\nTop query families by total time, rows read, and memory, plus tables accessed. Needs `@query_log.normalized_query_hash` — older spans (pre-enrichment) are absent.\n\n## Exact Query Families\nGrouped by `@query_log.normalized_query_hash` with `@query_log.normalized_query` preview — no tagging.\n\n## By Application\n`@log_comment.app` — needs client `log_comment` tagging (e.g. `{\"app\": \"my-app\"}`); blank until then.\n\n## By Named Query\n`@log_comment.query_name` — needs per-query `log_comment` naming (e.g. `{\"query_name\": \"home_dashboard\"}`); blank until then.",
              "background_color": "white",
              "font_size": "14",
              "text_align": "left",
              "vertical_align": "top",
              "show_tick": false,
              "has_padding": true
            },
            "layout": {
              "x": 0,
              "y": 0,
              "width": 12,
              "height": 18
            }
          }
        ]
      },
